{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj52W2VnPTbUiPYyPYvo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain wooden door, weathered and ancient. A single iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n**CLICK.**\n\n*The tumblers turn. The mechanism groans. A thin line of light splits the frame vertically as the door drifts open, slowly, revealing—*\n\nA warmth. A corridor stretching forward, lit by no visible source. The air smells of old paper and possibility.\n\n*The door holds itself open. Waiting.*\n\n🚪✨"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":113,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}